usage: review_cycle.py [-h] {stage,accept,select} ...

Stage immutable visual reviews with the Light-Science review engine. The
adapter never launches a model, fabricates a review, or certifies
independence. The host supplies a genuinely fresh review session and its
returned JSON. Host isolation remains separate from deterministic byte and
state checks.

positional arguments:
  {stage,accept,select}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit

